   "spoken": "The Chigorin — Nc6 against the Queen's Gambit, a committal, aggressive sideline that goes straight for White's centre. Think of it as the Scandinavian of 1.d4.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "The Chigorin blocks the c-pawn on purpose to attack d4 with pieces from move two."
