   "line": [
    "Nf3"
   ],
   "spoken": "The whole idea is to pile pressure on the d4-pawn immediately — dawdle and you're lost in five moves.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "In the Chigorin, every move must add pressure to d4; slow development loses on the spot."
  },
  {
   "ply": 8,
   "t": 103,
   "fen": "r1b1kbnr/ppp2ppp/2n5/3qp3/3P4/5N2/PP2PPPP/RNBQKB1R w KQkq - 0 5",
   "line": [
    "e5"
   ],
   "spoken": "e5 is the only move — the decisive central strike that makes the opening work.",
   "kind": "main"
  },
  {
   "ply": 9,
   "t": 124.5,
