   "line": [
    "Bg4"
   ],
   "spoken": "Against e3 — a passive try — we develop actively with Bg4, adding another attacker to d4. And the key detail to remember: if White plays Nc3, we have Bb4 to neutralize it; without that resource the whole line collapses.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "The Chigorin hangs on the ...Bb4 pin to answer Nc3; know it or the opening falls apart."
  },
